# Paths Claude should not read by default: large, binary, generated or unrelated.
# Advisory only: Claude Code does not enforce this file. It states intent for the assistant; read a
# listed path explicitly when a task needs it (e.g. an old run named in docs/EXPERIMENTS.md).
#
# Deliberately NOT listed:
#   archive/                      tasks copy functions from it into i2r/ and tools/
#   outputs/<structure>/          current runs; their JSON and PNG overlays are checked after each step
#   *.png / *.jpg                 overlays and test images are inspected visually

# Version control and IDE
.git/
.idea/
__pycache__/

# Old experiment runs (inventory in docs/EXPERIMENTS.md and archive/README.md)
outputs/restore_*/
outputs/run_*/
outputs/i2r_bakim_evi_*/

# Screenshots and loose assets (untracked)
assets/

# Model weights and caches
models/
loras/
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth

# Large binary data and archives
*.npy
*.npz
*.zip

# Logs (each run's run.log is read only when debugging)
*.log
